    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a scratch card simulation game, where players can win gold coins by scratching open popular scratch card lottery tickets. Your goal is to win 1 million! This game does not involve any real-world currency gambling or microtransactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your girlfriend issued an ultimatum to you,demanding you to marry her or  break up , so you walked into a lottery store and used the last bit of money  to buy scratch card lottery tickets, trying to take a chance to see if you can hit the jackpot, and if you do, you can get married to your lovely girlfriend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes four of the most popular scratch card lottery tickets on the market, with winning amounts ranging from 100  to 5000 gold coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing each lottery ticket, you can play a free roulette wheel game and earn up to 100000 gold coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your girlfriend will cheer and encourage you on site during the card scraping process</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cool special effects after winning the game, combined with the cheers of your girlfriend, will stimulate your dopamine levels with the thrill of winning</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a scratch card simulation game, where players can win gold coins by scratching open popular scratch card lottery tickets. Your goal is to win 1 million! This game does not involve any real-world currency gambling or microtransactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your girlfriend issued an ultimatum to you,demanding you to marry her or  break up , so you walked into a lottery store and used the last bit of money  to buy scratch card lottery tickets, trying to take a chance to see if you can hit the jackpot, and if you do, you can get married to your lovely girlfriend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes four of the most popular scratch card lottery tickets on the market, with winning amounts ranging from 100  to 5000 gold coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing each lottery ticket, you can play a free roulette wheel game and earn up to 100000 gold coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your girlfriend will cheer and encourage you on site during the card scraping process</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cool special effects after winning the game, combined with the cheers of your girlfriend, will stimulate your dopamine levels with the thrill of winning</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You're planning to marry your girlfriend, but you don't have any money, so you buy lottery tickets to see if you can win the jackpot in order to get the money for the wedding. This game does not contain any real-world monetary gambling or microtransactions.",
